n参考フォルダ：\n（ローブの装飾的な白い刺繍は、アニメ版とライトノベルの挿絵で異なります。どちらのバージョンを描くかはお任せします）", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tochikeisuke/works/168", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a7c901a8/uploads/origins/688fbffc-0090-42b2-9d95-ea76ebc81d5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e16d08316d41b718b37d294517c2a848", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 797808, "client_id": 270285, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 160, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tochikeisuke/works/167", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 797808, "client_id": 270285, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ed4deacb/uploads/origins/825de5f4-98a1-439d-bb52-f81382c50991?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=41ea623c5374efb53eac75e8d1811104", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ed4deacb/uploads/origins/825de5f4-98a1-439d-bb52-f81382c50991?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b7a252492d9fae77c92fa522977ea668", "src_set": ""}, "body": "ルイジェルド・スペルディアというキャラクターを描く。槍で武装した彼を描く。体の前側を描く。全身を描く。頭髪を描く（フォルダ内の画像1を参照）。額に埋め込まれた赤い石を描く。可能であれば、坊主頭とヘッドバンドを別レイヤーで描いてください（リファレンス・フォルダーの画像2を参照）。ポーズは何でもよい。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Cw578fLDKmlItWnI__Tr8xyX-V3AMiOQ?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tochikeisuke/works/166", "private_thumbnail_i